{"ticker":{"symbol":"062970.KQ","name":"한국첨단소재","market":"KR","exchange":""},"currency":"KRW","price":1925.0,"change_pct":-0.04228855721393032,"market_cap":54942003200.0,"pe":null,"pb":null,"dividend_yield":null,"week52_low":0.0,"week52_high":10100.0,"sector":"Technology","industry":"Communication Equipment","country":"South Korea","city":"Gwangju-si","employees":null,"website":"https://www.hankookam.com","business_summary":"KOREA ADVANCED MATERIALS Co., Ltd. produces and sells optical power splitters and arrayed waveguide gratings for use in high speed and FTTH networks. Its products include planar lightwave circuits (PLC) splitter chips and power splitter modules, mode conversion adapters, and arrayed waveguide gratings. The company also offers WDM solution, optical performance testing, optical power splitter, quantum cryptography, and optical system. The company was formerly known as PPI Inc. and changed its name to KOREA ADVANCED MATERIALS Co., Ltd. in October 2024. The company was founded in 1999 and is based in Gwangju-si, South Korea.","business_summary_ko":"한국첨단소재(주)는 고속 및 FTTH 네트워크에 사용되는 광파워 스플리터, 배열 도파로 격자를 생산, 판매하고 있습니다. 해당 제품에는 평면형 광파 회로(PLC) 스플리터 칩과 전력 스플리터 모듈, 모드 변환 어댑터, 배열 도파관 격자가 포함됩니다. 이 회사는 또한 WDM 솔루션, 광학 성능 테스트, 광 전력 분배기, 양자 암호화 및 광학 시스템을 제공합니다. 이 회사는 이전에는 PPI Inc.로 알려졌으며 2024년 10월에 KOREA ADVANCED MATERIALS Co., Ltd.로 이름을 변경했습니다. 이 회사는 1999년에 설립되었으며 대한민국 광주시에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","desc_ko":"","estimates":[{"period":"2026","rev":0.0,"rev_lo":0.0,"rev_hi":0.0,"rev_g":null},{"period":"2027","rev":0.0,"rev_lo":0.0,"rev_hi":0.0,"rev_g":null}],"ltg":null,"calendar":{},"industry_ko":"통신장비","financials":[{"period":"2022","revenue":21300638510.0,"operating_income":827152340.0,"net_income":504778220.0,"eps":50.428146},{"period":"2023","revenue":14413036040.0,"operating_income":-3022998250.0,"net_income":-4027424140.0,"eps":-404.359024},{"period":"2024","revenue":6504557430.0,"operating_income":-4796341010.0,"net_income":-14301215550.0,"eps":-1612.865022},{"period"